### Confidence-Based Reporting

The code-reviewer agent uses confidence scoring to reduce noise:

| Confidence | Action |
|------------|--------|
| 0-49 | Never report (false positives) |
| 50-74 | Report as "Important" |
| 75-100 | Report as "Critical" |

