## 4. Tool System

### Registry Architecture

```go
type Registry struct {
    tools       map[string]Tool      // tool name → Tool
    rateLimiter *ToolRateLimiter     // sliding-window per session
    scrubbing   bool                 // credential sanitization (default: true)
