```

---

## Performance Targets

| Format | Target Time | Reality Check |
|--------|------------|---------------|
| PDF (5MB) | <2s | ✅ pdfjs-dist is fast |
| DOCX (2MB) | <500ms | ✅ mammoth is lightweight |
